Imports, C# labels, documentation tags and distinctive .NET names provide
context that decays between cues and resets at document boundaries. This
context amplifies ordinary C# keywords. Familiar API names have their own
responses; unrecognized text stays at zero. This grouped approximation
omits many individual lexical differences and finer context effects.
