"""Sparse lexical responses, dominated by plus/minus notation.

Degrees, micro symbols, pm/PM, copyright signs and selected frequency words
also respond positively. Document nouns respond negatively; probability and
uncertainty words have signed offsets. Case, leading spaces and one preceding
same-document token adjust a few amplitudes. Other notation and chat markers
have small offsets; unrecognized tokens are zero. This is a lexical rule,
not a general semantic classifier.
