"""A mixed surface feature: Java infrastructure, division, and deliberation.

Named JVM/Spring packages and annotations get large positive values; familiar
Java type-name endings get smaller ones. Other rules recognize slash and TeX
separators, Maven metadata, interpolation, log labels, and '@'. 'Wait' and the
completions of "let me", "let us", or "let's" also respond. A 120-character
causal history resolves phrases and recent Spring namespaces, resetting at
each document.
Everything unrecognized gives zero; miscellaneous word-specific responses
are intentionally not memorized.
