This component is a negative detector for words that say how regularly, often or
normally something happens: "regular" / "regularly" (strongest), "frequently", "daily",
"often", "usually", "normal", "usual", "weekly", "basis" and their Chinese equivalents
(常, 每天). It is a per-word signal: its value depends on the current token, and is
about 0 on every other token (small positive values, e.g. "possible", are ignored).
